{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Horde Won't Stop is a top down shooter in a zombie post apocalyptical world. The aim is to survive as long as possible. Each level becomes progressively more difficult with more zombies to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/2025-05-12_Screenshot_7.png?t=1751314332\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have time to buy weapons after each level has been completed. You have a wide range of firearms, grenades, melee weapons and upgrades to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/2025-05-12_Screenshot_5.png?t=1751314332\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have full control over every action which includes moving, aiming, shooting, throwing grenades and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are several different types of zombies to keep things interesting and to make it more challenging for the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/Steam_Game_Header_rev_9_-_1232_x_706.png?t=1751314332\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643830?t=1751314332","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643830?t=1751314332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/2e92fed9714a3478cd46f081898492b1c42f0f75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751314332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/2e92fed9714a3478cd46f081898492b1c42f0f75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751314332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Horde Won't Stop is a top down shooter in a zombie post apocalyptical world. The aim is to survive as long as possible. Each level becomes progressively more difficult with more zombies to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/2025-05-12_Screenshot_7.png?t=1751314332\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have time to buy weapons after each level has been completed. You have a wide range of firearms, grenades, melee weapons and upgrades to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/2025-05-12_Screenshot_5.png?t=1751314332\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have full control over every action which includes moving, aiming, shooting, throwing grenades and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are several different types of zombies to keep things interesting and to make it more challenging for the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/Steam_Game_Header_rev_9_-_1232_x_706.png?t=1751314332\" /></div></p>","developers":["Reliable Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/f3eac13fa25c07841609e3004af553519756d9a0/header.jpg?t=1751314332","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257142321,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142321/movie480.mp4?t=174